@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
title SEQ-003 — Download, update and reopen offline
footer APPROVED D-016 DEC-076 | UC-007, UC-008, UC-009

actor Tourist
participant UI
participant "POI API / static distribution" as Host
participant "Service Worker / Cache Storage" as Cache
database IndexedDB as Local
Tourist -> UI: Download / Update
UI -> Host: Versioned manifest
Host --> UI: Files, hashes, sizes, compatibility
UI -> UI: Estimate storage; retain active package
loop Each required file
 UI -> Host: Download missing candidate file
 Host --> UI: Bytes / failure
 UI -> UI: Verify size and checksum
 UI -> Local: Store verified candidate
end
alt All assets and app shell verified
 UI -> Cache: Confirm shell-ready marker
 UI -> Local: Atomically switch active package pointer
else Network / integrity / quota error
 UI -> Local: Keep previous active package
 UI -> UI: Incomplete + Retry
end
Tourist -> UI: Close and reopen with no network
UI -> Cache: Load shell
UI -> Local: Load active English package and graph
alt Required resources present
 UI -> UI: Map/search/audio/GPS/routing locally
else Storage evicted / missing
 UI -> UI: No ready claim; re-download when online
end
opt Online sync receives deleted POI IDs
 UI -> UI: Hide deleted POI; stop affected navigation
end

@enduml
